  "description": "Welcome to Casa Arena, a beautifully appointed 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom apartment located in the prestigious Albatross Hill Club in Nueva Andalucía. Combining spacious interiors, high-quality furnishings, and exceptional community facilities, this is the perfect retreat for families, couples, or groups looking to enjoy Marbella in comfort and style.\n\nThe apartment features bright and spacious living areas designed with both elegance and relaxation in mind. The open and inviting layout flows seamlessly onto a large private balcony, complete with outdoor furniture and sunbeds, where you can unwind while taking in the beautiful surrounding views.\n\nEach bedroom has been thoughtfully designed to provide comfort and privacy, while the stylish interiors and premium finishes create a refined yet welcoming atmosphere throughout the home.\n\nSet within a secure gated community in the heart of Nueva Andalucía, guests have access to outstanding amenities including a fully equipped gym, sauna, indoor & outdoor swimming pool, and tennis court. The location offers easy access to Marbella’s renowned golf courses, beaches, restaurants, Puerto Banús, and all the attractions of the Costa del Sol while still providing a peaceful and exclusive setting.\n\nCasa Arena is the ideal choice for a luxurious and relaxing stay in one of Marbella’s most sought-after areas.\n\nPlease note: This property welcomes families and couples only. We do not accept groups under 30 or hen/stag parties. If you fall outside this category but would still like to book, please send us an enquiry with details about your group so we can consider your request.",
